### Get tokens for the demo users (any HTTP client; VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ format)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "erin"}

### Submit a $15,000 request (manager -> finance -> director)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/requests
Authorization: Bearer {{erinToken}}
Idempotency-Key: 6f1c2a9e-laptops-q1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Laptops for Q1 hires", "category": "hardware", "amount": 15000.00, "currency": "USD"}

### Manager's inbox
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/inbox
Authorization: Bearer {{miaToken}}

### Approve step 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{miaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment": "Approved for the Q1 hiring plan"}

### Full history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/requests/{{requestId}}/audit
Authorization: Bearer {{erinToken}}
